@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-native-owner-token
@operation = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@archiveSha256 = replace-with-64-hex-characters
@reviewHash = replace-with-reviewed-hash

### Private capabilities; all requests require HTTPS and owner authentication.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start or resume exactly the same archive identity.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"commandId":"{{operation}}","bytes":3,"sha256":"{{archiveSha256}}"}

### Raw part, maximum 524288 bytes. Replace abc and hash with real archive bytes.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations/{{operation}}/parts/0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream
X-MS3DFORGE-SHA256: {{archiveSha256}}

abc

### Verify archive, copy the server backup, compare, and prepare a candidate.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations/{{operation}}/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit the complete explicit conflict choices, maximum 10000 and 4 MiB JSON.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations/{{operation}}/choices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"path":"02_MODELES_3D/model.3mf","choice":"Pc"}]

### Inspect status after any uncertain activation response; do not issue another Apply.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations/{{operation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicitly activate only the verified reviewed candidate.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations/{{operation}}/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"commandId":"22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222","reviewHash":"{{reviewHash}}","confirmed":true}

### Missing operations return 404. Cookie mutations additionally require X-CSRF-TOKEN.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspace-migrations/operations/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
